# Accepted-risk findings for Trivy's image/misconfig/secret scans — see
# docs/ci.md#trivy-security-scans. One shared file, referenced by all
# three scan jobs' `trivyignores:` input via its .config/ path — same
# location as this repo's other tool configs (.ansible-lint, .yamllint,
# .dclintrc).
#
# One entry per line: a CVE ID (image scan), an AVD/check ID (Ansible
# misconfig scan), or a secret rule ID (secret scan). Blank lines and
# full-line '#' comments are ignored when Trivy parses this file — same
# convention as .github/compose-boot-test-exclusions.txt. Attach the
# reasoning for each entry directly above it, matching that file's
# style, rather than tracking justifications elsewhere.
#
# Empty for now — nothing has been triaged as accepted risk yet.
